          'Two people download the same open-weight model. The first asks it a borderline question and gets a polite refusal. The second downloaded a modified copy of the same base model, asks the identical question, and gets an answer. Same architecture, same knowledge, different behavior. That gap is the whole story of uncensored AI.',
